      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُثْفَةٌ</span></b>  The <i>changing, in pronunciation,</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">س</span> <i>into</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ث</span>, <i>or</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ر</span> <i>into</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غ</span> <i>or</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ل</span>, (S, K, Msb,) <i>and the like:</i>
(Msb:) or, <i>one letter into another.</i> (Az, in Msb,
K.) Also, <i>A word mispronounced;</i> as when a
word is said to be <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُغَةٌ أَوْ لُثْفَةٌ</span> <i>a dialectal variant
or a word mispronounced.</i>

